Q. What do I do if my trailer processing ended with an error?
A. The most common reason for a trailer to fail is the resolution of the video.
Please ensure you use a common resolution such as

1920x1080 or 1280x720 to avoid any downstream processing issues.

Another common issue is an unsupported audio sample rate

(please use 44Khz or 48Khz).


